---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use - ipofins" description="Terms and conditions for using ipofins finance tools and content.">
  <section class="container-narrow py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-surface-900 dark:text-white">Terms of Use</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-surface-600 dark:text-surface-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> June 2026</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Acceptance</h2>
      <p>By using ipofins, you agree to these terms. If you disagree, please discontinue use of the website.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Use of Information</h2>
      <p>All information on ipofins is for educational and informational purposes only. We are not SEBI-registered investment advisors. Do not make investment decisions solely based on information provided here.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Accuracy</h2>
      <p>While we strive for accuracy, data may be delayed, incomplete, or contain errors. Always verify information with official sources (BSE, NSE, AMFI, SEBI) before making financial decisions.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>ipofins shall not be liable for any losses, damages, or claims arising from the use of information or tools provided on this website. Investment in securities is subject to market risks.</p>
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-900 dark:text-white pt-4">Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. We may earn a commission when you open an account through our links, at no additional cost to you. This does not influence our analysis or recommendations.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
